        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.62,
          "end": 21.4,
          "en": "to control how much space the container takes up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.4,
          "end": 23.32,
          "en": "That's something we'll do in a second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.32,
          "end": 25.34,
          "en": "And then how the elements inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.34,
          "end": 27.11,
          "en": "of the container are positioned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
