        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.39,
          "end": 102.07,
          "en": "and that is the justify content property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.07,
          "end": 105.05,
          "en": "You will learn more about all these flex box properties",
